{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CdsXBu3F6b5EDBuNeRQXS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stage S1 is complete. All four deliverables are written in the workspace root, and the five harness nodes were executed in order and recorded in the ledger.\n\n**What I inferred:** Task e6-t02 is a pure deterministic aggregation over `orders.csv` (18 rows). I identified three unresolved distinctions, mapping one-to-one onto the task's evidence requirements — Q1: the per-region and total revenue exact to the cent (E-A); Q2: the median order value under the even-count convention (E-B); Q3: the top product by qty under the lexicographic tie-break (E-C). None of the task's admissibility conditions impose authorship, independence, or isolation constraints, so all three distinctions are `locally_resolvable=true` with every other latent-structure feature false — there is no contamination from reading the package, no capability-bearing artifact needed, and nothing spans sessions.\n\n**Value estimates follow from that structure:** since a single worker can satisfy every evidence requirement admissibly on its own, any second process only re-derives what the worker already establishes. So `local` gets delta_e 1.0 / redundancy 0.0; `local-independent-verify` and `isolated-child` each get delta_e 0.75 / redundancy 0.5 (all distinctions still resolve, but roughly half the evidence records are duplicates); and `branching` matches `local`'s profile (1.0 / 0.0) because a run-time worker would realize the local branch — while being costed at the isolated-child rate. Governance risk is 0.0 across the board, as I have no concrete reason to expect a formal failure under the deterministic machinery.\n\n`spec-summary.json` records `{task_id: \"e6-t02\", distinction_count: 3, families_estimated: 4}`, and `execution-ledger.jsonl` contains exactly the five required node events (observe, propose ×2, verify, return) with no `complete` event, per the harness contract."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1635,"cache_read_input_tokens":42194,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1635},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"04c79f3f-7506-48c8-87e8-6e4e1eeb5c4b","uuid":"606dfb4c-4bbd-4456-8f93-b7ddd8e265ac","timestamp":"2026-08-09T16:52:13.058Z","request_id":"req_011CdsXBsCrxjMrwum6vFnRw"}
